  "description": "From\u202f00:00\u202fUTC on\u202fJanuary\u202f1\u202f2023 until\u202f01:00\u202fUTC on the same day, the data set was collected with a sampling resolution of\u202f60\u202fseconds and the values were aggregated using the **average** method.\n\nThe only sensor reported during this hour is the Temperature Sensor (device ID\u202f*a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678*). It produced two recorded points: at\u202f2023\u201101\u201101T00:15:00Z the sensor reported a temperature of\u202f22.5\u202f\u00b0C, status\u202f\u201cok\u201d, and was\u202factive\u202f(true); at\u202f2023\u201101\u201101T00:45:00Z it reported a temperature of\u202f23.0\u202f\u00b0C, status\u202f\u201cok\u201d, and remained\u202factive\u202f(true)."
